ching_articulos", "label": "Lotes de articulos (batching)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "travis-nicholson/01-analisis.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "travis_nicholson_01_analisis_embudo", "label": "Embudo: visitas, clics y compras", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "travis-nicholson/01-analisis.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "travis_nicholson_01_analisis_avatar_angulos_hueco", "label": "Avatar y angulos (hueco sin cubrir)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "travis-nicholson/01-analisis.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Material casi sin ficha de avatar ni metodo de angulos. Es la prioridad 1 del proyecto, asi que hay que buscarla en otras fuentes."}, {"id": "travis_nicholson_01_analisis_umbrales_hueco", "label": "Umbrales de demanda (hueco sin cubrir)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "travis-nicholson/01-analisis.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El material no da ninguna puntuacion ni umbral de demanda (volumen de busqueda, resenas, etc.)."}, {"id": "travis_nicholson_gumroad", "label": "Gumroad", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "travis-nicholson/01-analisis.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "travis_nicholson_medium_seo", "label": "Medium y SEO de Google como motor de trafico", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "travis-nicholson/01-analisis.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Articulos posicionados en Google que enlazan al producto. Cifra del 80 por ciento de trafico es afirmacion no verificada."}, {"id": "travis_